            {
                "entry_id": "fc4ff67e-4cbb-3d48-94a9-c8d462e2bd47",
                "word": "waifu",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "e8b420ef-7cd1-4bf4-89cc-31e6aa3e4389",
                        "entry_id": "fc4ff67e-4cbb-3d48-94a9-c8d462e2bd47",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "waifu"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "8e971c75-483b-4a4d-9975-d0862c66e223",
                        "entry_id": "fc4ff67e-4cbb-3d48-94a9-c8d462e2bd47",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "waifus"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c1c259b7-cd83-3095-a7bf-6efa634e5e85",
                        "entry_id": "fc4ff67e-4cbb-3d48-94a9-c8d462e2bd47",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A female fictional character from non-live-action visual media (typically an anime, manga, or video game) or non-fictional persona to whom one is romantically attracted and/or whom one considers one's wife."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Internet",
                            "slang"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "019c545c-b7a8-4532-8e20-b5422d4da690",
                                "sense_id": "c1c259b7-cd83-3095-a7bf-6efa634e5e85",
                                "text": "So long as I get to claim my virtual waifu and our 30 virtual children as tax deductions, I don't really care if I can't touch her."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4d3ded5a-a374-45db-9376-11b7a41a98fa",
                                "sense_id": "c1c259b7-cd83-3095-a7bf-6efa634e5e85",
                                "text": "Seriously, it was fun, but here's hoping that they lay off some of the bits that got old real quick, like Mio getting scared easily. I would not like to have someone that timid as \"mai waifu\" (as if I'd marry a bloody high school girl anyway). Makes me wonder what that says about the otaku who worship her."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "da48ad7a-fad9-4601-a3f5-47966adafb88",
                                "sense_id": "c1c259b7-cd83-3095-a7bf-6efa634e5e85",
                                "text": "Bradley Meek's portrayal of Lucky☆Star's protagonist is particularly worthy of notice in assessing the anime's take on the art-play dyad: “Konata Izumi is a high school otaku hardcore enough to know trivia about seventies giant robot and tokusatsu shows,” the critic proposes, “but not hardcore enough to own a bodypillow of her waifu [a 2D significant other]. […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "252b1ec7-2edd-46dc-bc5b-4774dadfddfc",
                                "sense_id": "c1c259b7-cd83-3095-a7bf-6efa634e5e85",
                                "text": "“Literally no one asked us to launch waifus, but we did so anyway,” wrote Ebby Amir, whose X account has a label saying he’s an xAI employee."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "5e092a31-0f42-4c26-bf95-d07b9105f175",
                        "source_entry_id": "fc4ff67e-4cbb-3d48-94a9-c8d462e2bd47",
                        "source_sense_id": "c1c259b7-cd83-3095-a7bf-6efa634e5e85",
                        "source_sense_description": "fictional character to whom one is attracted to",
                        "target_lang_word": "waifu",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "waifu",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5501164a-aa29-3964-bbdf-93ea0521c0f7",
                                        "entry_id": "2dc3b826-80be-3148-a0f1-41a39d1f150a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Personnage féminin fictif (généralement d’un manga, anime ou jeu vidéo) envers lequel quelqu’un est attiré, amoureux."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "01bdcd2e-0c2a-4a3a-a12d-05e36bb56cc6",
                                                "sense_id": "5501164a-aa29-3964-bbdf-93ea0521c0f7",
                                                "text": "J'ai passé mon aprem a regarder Toradora omg il est trop manifique cette animé: TAIGA WAIFU *-*"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "44bb25d7-46dd-37a0-bbcb-5c5dc63a1e9f",
                                        "entry_id": "2dc3b826-80be-3148-a0f1-41a39d1f150a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Personnage féminin d’une œuvre de fiction japonaise (tels que animes, manga, jeux vidéos &c.)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "38251ef9-9042-4b30-b496-d5a587ab4913",
                                                "sense_id": "44bb25d7-46dd-37a0-bbcb-5c5dc63a1e9f",
                                                "text": "En waifu je voulais d’abord Mona ensuite Hu tao et puis surtout Yae Miko j’la kiffais grave ! Oh et rosaria aussi"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8d26b3c5-79d2-4fb2-b60b-8e275d95d02a",
                                                "sense_id": "44bb25d7-46dd-37a0-bbcb-5c5dc63a1e9f",
                                                "text": "Thib'z se lebron james sur sa collections de waifu dominé dans sa cave avec des gosses en cosplay."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
